questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a high-throughput Spring Boot microservice encounters continuous performance degradation and eventually throws `java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space` during nightly batch operations. A developer wrote the following service logic to process thousands of database records in smaller isolated transactions:

java
@Service
public class UserProcessingService {
    @Autowired
    private UserRepository userRepository;

    public void processBatch() {
        try (Stream<User> userStream = userRepository.streamAllBy()) {
            userStream.forEach(this::processSingleUser);
        }
    }

    @Transactional(propagation = Propagation.REQUIRES_NEW)
    public void processSingleUser(User user) {
        user.setStatus("PROCESSED");
        userRepository.save(user);
    }
}
